#: ../../source/index.rst:31 0813f30073cd46d984a945b6f0a4478b
msgid "_`What V1 does`"
msgstr "_`V1 做了什么`"

#: ../../source/index.rst:33 db05a85268ec43018a267372cc235b63
msgid ""
"Clarke / Park and their inverses, space-vector modulation, PI "
"controllers, a motor state machine and a back-EMF observer."
msgstr "Clarke / Park 及其逆变换、空间矢量调制、PI 控制器、电机状态机与反电动势观测器。"

#: ../../source/index.rst:35 25b3cbbe8b9149d0ba6536d7a98de191
msgid ""
"**Policy-composed motor**: observer, modulator, controller and HAL are "
"template parameters, so the whole current loop inlines into one "
"translation unit."
msgstr "**策略组合的电机**：观测器、调制器、控制器与 HAL 都是模板参数，整条电流环内联进一个翻译单元。"

#: ../../source/index.rst:37 701044adfd574b58a163f75eeee42406
msgid ""
"Simulation-grade HAL stubs (PWM duty history, scripted current, simulated"
" position), so the complete control chain can be exercised without "
"hardware."
msgstr "仿真级 HAL 桩（PWM 占空比历史、脚本化电流、模拟位置），无需硬件即可跑通完整控制链。"

#: ../../source/index.rst:39 bca943b22f3f4f50bd7775c0c090bff1
msgid ""
"A C API with generation-checked opaque handles: a stale handle is "
"*detected*, never dereferenced."
msgstr "带代际校验的不透明句柄的 C API：失效句柄会被*识别*，绝不解引用。"

#: ../../source/index.rst:41 dd4dee8587724ccb8e4fc078832894ad
msgid ""
"An optional pybind11 module that binds the **C API**, not the C++ "
"templates."
msgstr "可选的 pybind11 模块，绑定的是 **C API**，不是 C++ 模板。"

#: ../../source/index.rst:43 fceabeb38cb542cdb508c7c13ade936b
msgid ""
"All of this is verified in software only — see :ref:`honest limits "
"<honest-limits>`."
msgstr "以上全部只在软件层面验证——见 :ref:`诚实边界 <honest-limits>`。"

